# Line endings.
#
# Go tooling assumes LF. Without this, a Windows checkout gets CRLF and every
# single .go file fails `gofmt -l` on line endings alone, which makes the check
# useless. Setting it here rather than in each developer's git config means it
# applies to every clone automatically.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted — doing so corrupts them.
*.png binary
*.ttf binary
*.ico binary
